 duration-700"><img alt="Spotify Penjimat Senarai Main dengan Metadata" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeature3.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 text-center md:text-left"><h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">Spotify Penjimat Senarai Main dengan Metadata</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Setiap lagu yang dimuat turun daripada senarai main Spotify menggunakan SpotSaver termasuk metadata lengkap secara automatik dibenamkan dalam fail MP3. Ini termasuk tajuk lagu, nama artis, nama album, karya seni album dan nombor lagu. Senarai main anda yang dimuat turun disimpan dalam cara yang teratur yang berfungsi dengan sempurna dengan semua pemain muzik termasuk Apple Music, Windows Media Player, VLC dan mana-mana apl muzik Android atau iPhone. Tiada penandaan manual diperlukan. SpotSaver memastikan senarai main Spotify anda yang dimuat turun kelihatan dan dimainkan sama seperti dalam apl Spotify, walaupun semasa anda berada di luar talian sepenuhnya.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 max-w-[980px] mx-auto px-3 w-full"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 tracking-tight">Mengapa Gunakan SpotSaver Spotify Muat Turun Senarai Main?</h2><div class="h-1.5 w-16 bg-[#0f853c] dark:bg-[#1db954] mx-auto rounded-md"></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">Muat turun Keseluruhan Senarai Main Sekaligus</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">SpotSaver Muat Turun Semua ciri menyimpan setiap lagu dalam <a href="/ms/spotify-playlist-downloader/">senarai main Spotify</a> dalam satu klik. Tidak perlu memuat turun trek satu persatu. Simpan ratusan lagu dari mana-mana senarai main serta-merta dan percuma sepenuhnya.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">320kbps Audio <a href="/ms/spotify-to-mp3/">MP3</a> Berkualiti Tinggi</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Setiap lagu yang dimuat turun daripada senarai main Spotify disimpan dalam kualiti sehingga 320kbps <a href="/ms/spotify-to-mp3/">MP3</a>, kadar bit audio tertinggi yang tersedia. Nikmati bunyi sejernih kristal yang sepadan dengan kualiti audio Spotify sendiri, walaupun semasa di luar talian.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">Tiada Akaun atau Pendaftaran Diperlukan</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Mula memuat turun senarai main Spotify serta-merta tanpa membuat sebarang akaun. Tiada alamat e-mel, tiada kata laluan, tiada borang pendaftaran diperlukan. Hanya tampal pautan senarai main dan muat turun muzik anda dengan segera.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 12c-2-2.67-4-4-6-4a4 4 0 1 0 0 8c2 0 4-1.33 6-4Zm0 0c2 2.67 4 4 6 4a4 4 0 0 0 0-8c-2 0-4 1.33-6 4Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">Berfungsi pada Semua Peranti dan Penyemak Imbas</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">SpotSaver ialah alat berasaskan web yang berjalan sepenuhnya dalam penyemak imbas anda. Muat turun senarai main Spotify pada iPhone, Android, Windows, Mac atau Linux tanpa memasang sebarang apl atau perisian.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"></line><line x1="10" x2="8" y1="9" y2="9"></line></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">Muat Turun Senarai Main Percuma Tanpa Had</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Muat turun seberapa banyak senarai main Spotify yang anda mahu, percuma sepenuhnya. Tiada had muat turun harian, tiada pelan langganan dan tiada yuran tersembunyi. Simpan senarai main tanpa had dengan sekatan sifar.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">Metadata Penuh Dibenamkan Secara Automatik</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Setiap lagu senarai main yang dimuat turun termasuk karya seni album, nama artis, tajuk lagu dan nombor lagu yang dibenamkan secara automatik. Pustaka muzik anda kekal teratur dengan sempurna tanpa sebarang usaha manual.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 max-w-[980px] mx-auto px-3 w-full"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 tracking-tight">Spotify Muat Turun Senarai Main – Soalan Lazim</h2><div class="h-1.5 w-16 bg-[#0f853c] dark:bg-[#1db954] mx-auto rounded-md"></div></div><div class="p-2 md:p-6 rounded-md border bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] dark:bg-[#121212] dark:border-white/10 dark:shadow-none"><div class="border-b last:border-0 border-black/5 dark:border-white/5"><button class="w-full py-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left group cursor-pointer px-4" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg transition-colors flex-1 pr-4 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-black dark:text-white">Apakah itu Spotify pemuat turun senarai main?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><path